# Campus Albano

Rebuild [campus Albano](https://campusalbano.se/view/all) as a Babylon.js viewer. Match the light architectural model, left category accordion, colored POI markers, and article dialog.

- Left pan, right rotate, scroll zoom
- Categories: Welcome, University facilities, Student Housing, Sustainability, Webcams, Pictures, Places, Read more
- Eye icon toggles that category’s markers
- Clicking a list item or marker opens the article dialog
